---
layout: base.njk
title: null
description: "The place that I post all my projects, papers, articles, and anything else."
---
{% from "article-card.njk" import card %}
<section class="wrap hero">
  <h1 class="hero__title">The website for stuff I work on.</h1>
  <p class="hero__lede">
    Carney Journal will be the place that I post all my projects, papers, articles, and anything else. The site is relatively new, so if there is not much stuff here there will be in the future.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="wrap section">
  <div class="section__head">
    <h2>Latest</h2>
    <a href="/articles/">All articles &rarr;</a>
  </div>
  <div class="card-grid">
    {% for article in collections.articles | limit(6) %}
      {{ card(article) }}
    {% else %}
      <p class="empty">No articles yet.</p>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
